NPC action oracle hooks for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-10-16. See LICENSE (SFI-SCLA).
Lets the NPC action probes run HandleNPCDoAction, the requestor boxes and HandleNPCSystemEvent headless: in
Interface_Dialogue.cc the CheckFact calls of HandleNPCDoAction and DialogueMessageBoxCallBack go through
OracleTracedCheckFact and TalkingMenuDialogue, NPCDoAction and NPCGotoGridNo are traced like the 0013 hooks of NPC.cc;
with gOracleSkipDialogueBoxes set, StartDialogueMessageBox records the box type without opening a message box;
appended accessors read the box type and the lie prompt record and answer a box through the static
DialogueMessageBoxCallBack. In Strategic_Event_Handler.cc the CheckFact calls are traced as well. No behaviour change
while the flag is clear and no trace is collected. Applied by tools/oracle/build.sh after 0014.

